N|deployment|compose|built and verified
N|deployment|personal|
N|deployment|scaled-out|
N|gate|ci/api|
N|gate|ci/brain|
N|gate|ci/node|
N|gate|ci/contracts|
N|gate|ci/image|
N|document|README.md|
N|document|DIRECTION.md|
