N|witness|FRICTION.md 1|a Router.add handler dangles
N|witness|FRICTION.md 2|no triple-quoted strings
N|witness|FRICTION.md 3|no reason phrases
N|witness|hale#1048|
N|witness|voice#2|
E|unfold|parent=process:api|child=seed:api
E|unfold|parent=process:brain|child=seed:brain
E|unfold|parent=process:node|child=seed:node
E|unfold|parent=process:postgres|child=contract:spec/store.md
E|unfold|parent=process:nats|child=contract:spec/protocol.yaml
E|unfold|parent=process:nats|child=contract:spec/internal.yaml
E|meets|contract=contract:spec/openapi.yaml|server=process:api|consumer=seed:ui|consumer=process:node|via=HTTP|outside=callers
E|meets|contract=contract:spec/node.yaml|server=process:node|via=HTTP|outside=the machine's operator
E|meets|contract=contract:spec/protocol.yaml|server=process:node|consumer=process:api|carrier=process:nats|via=NATS
E|meets|contract=contract:spec/internal.yaml|server=process:brain|consumer=process:api|carrier=process:nats|via=NATS
E|meets|contract=contract:spec/store.md|server=process:postgres|consumer=process:api|consumer=process:brain|via=SQL
E|meets|contract=contract:spec/vendor/open-responses|consumer=contract:spec/openapi.yaml|consumer=contract:spec/protocol.yaml
E|names|contract=contract:spec/openapi.yaml|noun=noun:model|noun=noun:account|noun=noun:node|noun=noun:seat|noun=noun:project|noun=noun:key|noun=noun:request|noun=noun:usage record
E|names|contract=contract:spec/store.md|noun=noun:reservation|noun=noun:usage record|noun=noun:change|noun=noun:policy change
E|refers|from=noun:seat|to=noun:engine
